summary.label:
The Flick Electric Co. app is the first to give Kiwis real-time info about the forecast price of power and the carbon impact of the New Zealand national grid. The app is free for everyone to use - Flickster or not - as part of our commitment to bringing smarter energy choices to New Zealand.

Download the Flick Electric Co. app to be part of the future of electricity!

FLICKSTER FEATURES
If you’re a Flick Electric customer, great! The app helps give you power over your power with features including: 

-	Live display of your forecast electricity price (plus estimated cost of the next half hour, and your appliances!); 
-	Your carbon impact based on the electricity that your household has used;
-	Live information about the total carbon impact of electricity generation;
-	Information about the different types of electricity generation in New Zealand and their emissions;  
-	Access to your current electricity spend and latest bills;
-	Access to your Volt, to help you better manage your budget; and
-	The ability to configure app alerts, helping you know when you can best save money or reduce your emissions.

FEATURES FOR EVERYONE
If you’re not a Flick Electric customer that’s ok too! When you flick the switch, you get what you get, regardless of the power company you’re with. Even though New Zealand makes lots of clean electricity, just a little bit of the dirty stuff has a big carbon impact. So, for the first time, we’re also giving ALL Kiwis a live snapshot of what’s in the national grid:

-	Live information about the total carbon impact of electricity generation; 
-	Information about the different types of electricity generation in New Zealand and their emissions.
-	The ability to configure app alerts, helping you know when you can best reduce your emissions;
-	Live display of the forecast electricity price at, and emissions impact of, Flick HQ
